Chip C_server (one core; area budget 4608 KB for L2 + LLC): ooo_cpu: lq_size 192, rob_size 512, scheduler_size 192, sq_size 114; physical_memory: channels 2, data_rate 3200
Objective: maximise ipc, the geometric mean of IPC over W1 + W2 + W3.
Concerns and their knobs: prefetch (l1d_prefetcher, l2_prefetcher, llc_prefetcher); geometry (l1d_sets, l1d_ways, l2_sets, l2_ways, llc_sets, llc_ways); replacement (l2_replacement, llc_replacement); concurrency (l2_mshr, llc_mshr).

## Knobs and allowed values
- l1d_sets: [32, 64, 128]
